            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Turn your notes into tasks

- Use your voice notes as a to-do list: mark them done with a click and focus on what’s left. Completed ones are kept aside, and the widget shows only what you still have to do. Turn it on in Voice Notes → Tasks.
]]></description>
